{
  "title": "Hearty Irish Water Chestnut Stew",
  "description": "A pungent and crowd-pleasing Irish dish featuring water chestnut, this stew is perfect for a cold winter's night. It has a cheese-pull and can be cooked in a hot-pot vessel.",
  "cuisine": "Irish",
  "diet": [
