      "name": "irish cheddar",
      "amount": "1 cup",
      "notes": "shredded"
    },
    {
      "name": "yakimono sauce",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "for grill"
    },
    {
      "name": "vegetable broth",
      "amount": "4 cups",
      "notes": "low sodium"
    },
    {
      "name": "fresh parsley",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the yakimono grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Grill the sliced water chestnuts for 2-3 minutes per side, until slightly charred.",
    "In a large hot-pot vessel, saute the chopped onions and carrots in a little bit of oil until tender.",
    "Add the chopped potatoes, vegetable broth, and shredded irish cheddar to the vessel.",
    "Stir until the cheese is melted and the stew is heated through.",
    "Add the grilled water chestnuts and chopped parsley to the stew.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
  ],
